# Internal build-history / scope-negotiation records, not meant for public consumption --
# README.md is the public-facing architecture/design writeup instead.
TASKS.md
DEMO.md

# NOTE: frontend/dist/ is intentionally NOT ignored -- the built React SPA is what the
# FastAPI backend serves, and `databricks bundle deploy` respects .gitignore when syncing
# source files. An earlier unscoped "dist/"/"build/" pattern here (meant for Python
# packaging, which this project doesn't use) was silently also matching frontend/dist/
# and frontend build/, so the deployed app served the "frontend not built" fallback even
# though npm run build had been run locally. Do not re-add a bare "dist/"/"build/" pattern.
